config MFG_SPEAKER_GAIN_MDB
    int "Factory speaker test gain (mdB)"
    depends on SPEAKER
    default -25000
    help
      Gain the factory speaker test plays its tone at, the level the test
      is qualified at on the board.

config MFG_HRM_CTR_LEAKAGE
    bool "Factory heart rate CTR and light leakage test"
    default y
    depends on MFG && PPG_GH3X2X && BOARD_OBELIX
    help
      The factory test of the optical stack: crosstalk (CTR) and light
      leakage, measured with raw samples of the GH3X2X front end.
